  "description": "Luce has had a huge crush on Kevin since their police school days, but hasn't had the chance to confess his feelings. Right when the two of them are about to wrap up an illegal aphrodisiac case, Luce accepts some donuts from a seemingly harmless admirer and gives them to a hungry Kevin. Unfortunately, these donuts are laced with the same aphrodisiac that's been plaguing the public! Poor Kevin has to climax ten times to get it all out of his system, and there's only one person around who can help him with the job...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's OOTD Danpyeonseon (OOTD 단편선) Collection.*",
